# steps/table-receiver.md §8: peek, a method of the part unit_s7_part_free_bound_part.lm2 (harness Parts),
# reads k, which neither it nor any of its callers binds; the source declares k only as a field of Holder --
# no binding of a caller.  The root's call of peek is refused: "unbound dynamic input k".
Holder:
    size_t: k 5U
return
size_t: got 0U
got: peek()
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: 7; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
